        "Content": "Take a Virtual Tour here:\r\nhttps://view.ricoh360.com/0e8574a4-897f-4da6-8e53-dcff9438c72f\r\n\r\nKeller Williams Castles are delighted to present new to the market No 186a St James's Road, Greenhills.\r\n\r\nThis property offers an outstanding opportunity to acquire this impressive six-bedroom detached residence with full attic conversion, occupying a commanding corner site in the highly sought-after Greenhills area of Dublin 12. The property benefits from three self-contained, independently accessed annexes — each in existence for in excess of 15 years — offering exceptional income-generating potential or multi-generational living arrangements from day one.\r\n\r\nWith a total of ten bedrooms across the main home and three annexes, double glazing throughout, and a large private driveway and rear garden, this property represents one of the most versatile and compelling offerings to come to market in Dublin 12 in recent years.\r\n\r\nNo 186a is a beautifully appointed six-bedroom detached home presented in excellent condition throughout, featuring high-quality finishes, hardwood flooring, and generous room proportions across all levels.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nGround Floor:\r\n\r\nEntrance porch\r\nLarge hallway with hardwood flooring\r\nFront lounge\r\nBeautiful interconnecting kitchen with island unit\r\nLarge dining room\r\nInterconnecting sitting room with double doors to rear garden\r\nFeature fireplace\r\nConservatory off kitchen\r\n\r\n\r\nFirst Floor:\r\n\r\nBedroom 1: Double room with fitted wardrobes\r\nBedroom 2: Double room with fitted wardrobes\r\nBedroom 3: Double room with fully tiled ensuite\r\nBedroom 4: Double room with built-in wardrobes\r\nBedroom 5: Single bedroom\r\nFamily bathroom fully tiled with rainwater shower\r\n\r\n\r\nAttic:\r\n\r\nFull length attic room/storage area\r\nSuitable for office/extra bedroom (subject to planning permission if required)\r\n\r\n\r\nEXTERNAL FEATURES\r\n\r\nLarge corner site\r\nAmple front driveway parking\r\nLarge rear garden\r\nMature boundaries and hedging\r\nPatio area\r\n\r\n\r\nThe property also includes three self-contained annex units to the side and rear. These are described as having been in existence for over 15 years and are currently unauthorised structures (planning status not confirmed).\r\n\r\nAnnex 1:\r\n\r\nOne-bedroom studio style unit\r\nDouble shower room\r\nGas central heating\r\n\r\n\r\nAnnex 2:\r\n\r\nTwo-bedroom unit\r\nLarge kitchen/dining area\r\nShower room\r\nGas central heating\r\n\r\n\r\nAnnex 3:\r\n\r\n\r\nOne-bedroom studio style unit\r\nShower room\r\nGas central heating\r\n\r\nAdditional Features:\r\nDouble glazing throughout main residence\r\nGas central heating (annexes)\r\nLarge corner site with significant development potential\r\nSuitable for extended family use or investment (subject to planning permission)\r\nWith three established annexes generating independent rental income, this property offers a compelling investment case in one of Dublin's most accessible southside locations. Dublin 12 benefits from excellent transport links, proximity to the city centre, and sustained rental demand.\r\n\r\nViewing highly recommended and strictly by appointment only."
      }
